{"id":"c53ee8b5af941c0e","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-extended-frege.md","title":"Extended Frege","display":"df-extended-frege — Extended Frege","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-extended-frege","aliases":["72-df-extended-frege"],"display":"df-extended-frege — Extended Frege","depends_on":["[[72-df-frege-system]]","[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 8.1.5 and Definition 8.1.6; printed pp. 591-592; PDF pp. 603-604","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-extended-frege"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-extended-frege</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extended-frege — Extended Frege"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 8.1.5 and Definition 8.1.6; printed pp. 591-592; PDF pp. 603-604"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\">\\(i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EF}_R\\vdash\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{EF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\)</span> 是 Assertion 定义的扩展 Frege 定理关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExtStep}(\\pi,i,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\pi_i=(e\\leftrightarrow A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(\\tau)\\cup\\bigcup_{j&lt;i}\\operatorname{Var}(\\pi_j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExtStep}(\\pi,i,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\pi_i=(e\\leftrightarrow A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(\\tau)\\cup\\bigcup_{j&lt;i}\\operatorname{Var}(\\pi_j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j&lt;i\\},\\pi_i)\\lor\\operatorname{ExtStep}(\\pi,i,\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j&lt;i\\},\\pi_i)\\lor\\operatorname{ExtStep}(\\pi,i,\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§8.1.5 及 Definition 8.1.6，印刷页 591–592，PDF 页 603–604。</li>\n<li>原先静态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtAx}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtAx}(\\tau)\\)</span> 没有绑定完整的扩展序列，也未排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\operatorname{Var}(A)\">\\(e\\in\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\)</span>；例如允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\leftrightarrow\\neg e\">\\(e\\leftrightarrow\\neg e\\)</span> 会破坏可靠性。现按证明位置检查新变量，排除自身、全部先前证明行和最终结论中的出现。</li>\n<li>用扩展定义的逆序代入可消去新变量，故扩展行不把新的原语言假命题引入系统。此处只核对了来源条件及这个可靠性论证，没有提供多项式消去界；展开可能很大。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-frege-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EF}_R\\vdash\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExtStep}(\\pi,i,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\;\n\\Bigl(&\\pi_i=(e\\leftrightarrow A)\\\\\n&\\land e\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(\\tau)\\cup\\bigcup_{j<i}\\operatorname{Var}(\\pi_j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)>0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j<i\\},\\pi_i)\\lor\\operatorname{ExtStep}(\\pi,i,\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{EFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtAx}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\operatorname{Var}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\leftrightarrow\\neg e","display":false}],"bytes":2429,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-336","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-extended-frege|df-extended-frege — Extended Frege]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-extended-frege — Extended Frege](72-df-extended-frege.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-extended-frege|df-extended-frege — Extended Frege]]"},{"id":"b07cf6e91885e3f6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$\\operatorname{SFProof}$，$\\operatorname{EFProof}$ 分别如 [[72-df-frege-system]]、[[72-df-substitution-frege]]、[[72-df-extended-frege]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-extended-frege]]"}],"outgoing":["f35aac82e